@host = http://localhost:5180

### Santé
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Connexion du personnel (copier le jeton dans @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/staff/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@2026!" }

###
@token = COLLER_LE_JETON_ICI

### Tableau de bord
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clients
GET {{host}}/api/clients?search=&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Commandes prêtes
GET {{host}}/api/orders/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rapport (30 derniers jours)
GET {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
